1
00:00:03,80 --> 00:00:05,36
We are so in luck!
我們走運了

2
00:00:05,57 --> 00:00:08,13
Treeger said we could have all this cool stuff!
房東說這些好東西都可以給我們

3
00:00:08,60 --> 00:00:09,73
Wait right there.
等一下

4
00:00:10,44 --> 00:00:12,80
Oh,no. I'm paddling away.
不行，我要劃走了

5
00:00:16,38 --> 00:00:19,31
Really? We got all this rusty crap for free?
真的？ 這些生蛌漫U圾不要錢？

6
00:00:21,45 --> 00:00:26,05
This and a bunch of bubble wrap. And some of it is not even popped.
還有一堆泡泡棉 有些完全沒擠過

7
00:00:33,96 --> 00:00:36,06
Could we be more white trash?
我們真是白人垃圾

8
00:00:37,90 --> 00:00:39,96
The One with the Cuffs
本集播出：「愛的手銬」

00:00:41,90 --> 00:00:43,96
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

9
00:01:25,21 --> 00:01:26,87
How desperate am l?
我真是絕望透了

10
00:01:27,48 --> 00:01:31,42
Good thing Chandler's not here. He always wins at this game.
幸好錢德不在，誰也慘不過他

11
00:01:31,72 --> 00:01:33,91
I just told my mom I'd cater her party.
我剛答應幫我媽的宴會辦外燴

12
00:01:34,12 --> 00:01:36,39
-How come? -I need the money.
為什麼？ 因為我需要錢

13
00:01:36,66 --> 00:01:41,29
It'd be a great way to get rid of that last smidgen of self-respect.
而且這樣正好可以拋開 最後一絲自尊

15
00:01:41,50 --> 00:01:43,23
I think this is a good thing.
別這樣，這是好事啊

16
00:01:43,47 --> 00:01:47,30
Mom wouldn't have hired you if you weren't good.
要不是覺得你行，媽不會找你

17
00:01:47,57 --> 00:01:51,51
You don't have to stick up for her. She can't hear you.
你不必替她說話，她聽不到

18
00:01:54,11 --> 00:01:55,47
Do you have any juice?
你們有果汁嗎？

19
00:01:55,74 --> 00:01:56,97
Just pickle.
只有醃黃瓜汁

20
00:01:58,88 --> 00:02:02,25
Funny story. I bumped into Joanna yesterday.
瑞秋，說來好笑 我昨天在路上遇見喬安娜

21
00:02:03,38 --> 00:02:06,01
My boss,Joanna? That must have been awkward.
我的上司喬安娜？一定很尷尬

22
00:02:06,22 --> 00:02:08,85
Actually,she asked me if I wanted a drink.
事實上她找我一起去喝酒

23
00:02:10,69 --> 00:02:13,59
You didn't say yes to that, did you?
你沒有答應吧？

24
00:02:14,90 --> 00:02:16,96
沒有

25
00:02:17,17 --> 00:02:18,53
Hello,Rachel.
瑞秋

26
00:02:23,00 --> 00:02:24,53
Well,not at first.
一開始沒答應

27
00:02:25,91 --> 00:02:27,74
What is she doing here?
她在這裡幹什麼？

28
00:02:33,65 --> 00:02:37,08
Last time you went out with her you said she was a dud!
我不懂 你上次跟她約會時說她很無聊

29
00:02:37,32 --> 00:02:42,12
I judged her too quickly. This time,we took it to the next level.
我太快下定論了 這次我們進展到下一個階段

30
00:02:45,39 --> 00:02:49,89
Last time I almost got fired. You must end it. You must end it now.
我上次差點被炒魷魚 你馬上給我做個了結

31
00:02:50,13 --> 00:02:52,26
It's not an everyday occurrence!
這可不是每天都有的事

32
00:02:52,50 --> 00:02:54,99
Usually I'm in there by myself.
通常我都一個人睡

34
00:03:01,91 --> 00:03:03,07
Promise.
答應我…

35
00:03:03,41 --> 00:03:05,38
-Rachel,aren't you running late? -No
瑞秋，你快遲到了吧？ 沒有啊

36
00:03:05,55 --> 00:03:08,68
-You are if you pick me up a bagel. -Okay.
有，你還要幫我買焙果 好

37
00:03:09,58 --> 00:03:12,18
Promise you will end this now.
錢德，答應我跟她分手

38
00:03:13,52 --> 00:03:16,32
-I promise. I'll end it. -Thank you.
好，我會跟她分手 謝謝

39
00:03:16,56 --> 00:03:18,65
I hope you know what I'm giving up.
不過我的犧牲很大

40
00:03:18,86 --> 00:03:22,56
She's not just the boss in your office. You know what I mean?
她可不只是你的上司，懂嗎？

41
00:03:27,07 --> 00:03:28,93
Sorry. I knew what he meant.
對不起，我懂

42
00:03:34,34 --> 00:03:36,00
How's the hired help?
外燴大廚忙得怎樣？

43
00:03:36,54 --> 00:03:38,88
Doing great. Quiches are coming along.
很順利，乳酪火腿餡餅快好了

44
00:03:39,18 --> 00:03:41,17
What's this? Blue nail polish?
這是什麼？藍色指甲油？

45
00:03:42,45 --> 00:03:44,18
I thought it was cute.
對，我覺得很好看

46
00:03:44,39 --> 00:03:48,62
It's what your grandmother's hands looked like when we found her.
你奶奶死後指甲就是這個顏色

47
00:03:50,86 --> 00:03:52,26
Let me ask you a question.
我問你一個問題

48
00:03:53,43 --> 00:03:54,62
Why did you hire me?
你為什麼找我？

49
00:03:55,06 --> 00:03:57,79
Richard raved about the food at his party...
理查一直說他的派對餐點很棒

50
00:03:58,03 --> 00:03:59,73
...but you were sleeping with him.
但你當時在跟他上床

51
00:03:59,93 --> 00:04:03,27
Then I heard the food at that lesbian wedding was nice.
後來我聽說 那場同志婚禮的菜很好

52
00:04:03,61 --> 00:04:06,37
I assume you didn't sleep with anyone there.
你應該沒跟那些人上床吧

53
00:04:06,61 --> 00:04:08,87
At least that would be something.
起碼很特別

54
00:04:10,81 --> 00:04:13,25
Oh,my God! Did you hear that?
天哪！你聽到了嗎？

55
00:04:13,65 --> 00:04:16,14
She hired me because she thinks I'm good.
她是覺得我很行才找我

56
00:04:18,79 --> 00:04:19,91
I didn't hear that.
我沒聽到這個

57
00:04:21,32 --> 00:04:23,55
She didn't hire me out of pity.
她不是在可憐我

58
00:04:23,76 --> 00:04:27,99
It wasn't so she could pick on me. She actually thinks I'm good.
不是想在朋友面前刁我 她是真的覺得我行

59
00:04:29,33 --> 00:04:31,80
And hey,it's cool if you're a lesbian.
還有，如果你是同志就太酷了

60
00:04:47,18 --> 00:04:50,81
Good afternoon. Are you the decision-maker of the house?
午安，你是這裡的家長嗎？

61
00:04:56,66 --> 00:04:59,82
Do you currently own a set of encyclopedias?
你目前擁有一套百科全書嗎？

62
00:05:00,03 --> 00:05:03,96
No,but try the classifieds. People sell everything in there.
沒有 不過分類廣告上什麼都有

63
00:05:04,20 --> 00:05:07,07
Actually,I'm not buying. I'm selling.
我不是要買，我是要賣

64
00:05:07,27 --> 00:05:09,17
Let me ask you one question.
我問你一個問題

65
00:05:09,64 --> 00:05:12,16
Do your friends ever have a conversation...
你是否曾在朋友們聊天時

66
00:05:12,37 --> 00:05:16,83
...and you just nod along, not sure what they're talking about?
只能跟著點頭 卻搞不懂他們在說什麼？

67
00:05:22,02 --> 00:05:25,35
I'm telling you, it's totally unconstitutional.
告訴你，這根本是違憲 沒錯

68
00:05:28,62 --> 00:05:30,89
I think he deserves a Nobel Prize.
我覺得他應該得諾貝爾獎

69
00:05:31,56 --> 00:05:33,39
才怪

70
00:05:35,06 --> 00:05:37,69
It was like the Algonquin kids' table.
很像阿爾岡京族小孩的桌子

71
00:05:41,87 --> 00:05:43,36
Excuse me. I'm sorry.
抱歉，對不起

72
00:05:43,67 --> 00:05:46,66
You haven't said anything for about two minutes.
你發了大約2分半鐘的呆

73
00:05:46,87 --> 00:05:48,50
Are you at all interested?
你到底有沒有興趣？

74
00:05:50,31 --> 00:05:51,51
Come on in.
有…請進

75
00:05:55,22 --> 00:05:56,55
-That's weird. -What?
怪了 什麼？

76
00:05:56,88 --> 00:05:57,82
Your nails.
你的假指甲

77
00:05:58,02 --> 00:06:02,55
I wore fake ones so my mom wouldn't give me grief about biting them.
我知道，我怕咬指甲被我媽念

78
00:06:02,82 --> 00:06:06,35
I meant,it's weird that you only have nine now.
我是說你現在只有九個指甲

79
00:06:08,93 --> 00:06:10,26
Oh,my God!
天哪

80
00:06:11,60 --> 00:06:12,83
Wait a minute.
等一下

81
00:06:13,17 --> 00:06:14,66
I had them when I put
我之前要烤…

82
00:06:15,10 --> 00:06:16,93
Oh,my God! It's in the quiche!
天哪，在餡餅裡面

83
00:06:18,24 --> 00:06:20,23
-Oh,my God! -Okay,don't panic.
完了！ 好，不要慌

84
00:06:20,51 --> 00:06:22,53
I'll go buy you a new set of nails.
我去幫你買一組新指甲

85
00:06:22,74 --> 00:06:25,24
No one will know, and you'll look great!
沒有人會知道，你還是很美

86
00:06:27,38 --> 00:06:30,87
It's because they're going to eat That's the problem.
你是怕他們會吃到

87
00:06:32,45 --> 00:06:34,35
Honey,don't bite your nails.
女兒，別咬指甲

88
00:06:37,39 --> 00:06:39,09
Please don't freak out.
你別發飆

89
00:06:40,13 --> 00:06:43,43
There's a blue fingernail in one of the quiche cups.
不過某個餡餅裡有一片假指甲

90
00:06:43,70 --> 00:06:46,13
And there's no way to know which one.
而且無從找起

91
00:06:48,47 --> 00:06:51,77
And whoever finds it wins the prize!
找到的人可以中大獎

92
00:06:53,14 --> 00:06:54,51
I'm not freaking out.
我不會發飆

93
00:06:54,71 --> 00:06:58,61
-Why are you laughing? -Now your father owes me $5.
你在笑什麼？ 沒事，你爸輸我5塊錢

94
00:06:59,45 --> 00:07:00,78
You bet I'd lose a nail?
你賭我會掉指甲？

95
00:07:00,98 --> 00:07:04,25
Don't be silly. I just bet that I'd need these.
別傻了 我只是賭我會用上這個

96
00:07:04,62 --> 00:07:06,31
Frozen lasagnas?
冷凍千層面？

97
00:07:08,22 --> 00:07:10,12
You bet that I'd screw up?
你賭我會搞砸？

98
00:07:10,66 --> 00:07:13,25
All that stuff about how I was good
你還說什麼我很行…

99
00:07:13,46 --> 00:07:14,89
No,that was all true.
不，那都是真的

100
00:07:15,10 --> 00:07:17,79
This was just in case you "pulled a Monica."
這只是怕你搞摩妮卡飛機

101
00:07:18,57 --> 00:07:21,97
You promised Dr. Weinberg you'd never use that phrase.
你答應心理醫生不再這麼說

102
00:07:22,30 --> 00:07:24,17
Come on. Have a sense of humor.
拜託，有點幽默感嘛

103
00:07:24,41 --> 00:07:26,81
You're never able to laugh at yourself.
你總是不懂得自嘲

104
00:07:27,07 --> 00:07:28,27
That's right.
是啊

105
00:07:29,41 --> 00:07:32,14
My mom has no faith in me! That's hilarious!
我媽對我沒信心，好好笑喔

106
00:07:34,58 --> 00:07:35,78
I don't get it.
哪裡好笑？

107
00:07:37,52 --> 00:07:39,28
No. I have faith.
不，我對你有信心

108
00:07:39,49 --> 00:07:41,28
No. You have lasagnas!
不，你有的是千層面

109
00:07:48,80 --> 00:07:50,59
The ruined quiches are ready!
毀掉的餡餅好了

110
00:07:59,64 --> 00:08:03,20
-I really don't think we should be doing this. -Okay.
我們不該這麼做 好

111
00:08:06,65 --> 00:08:09,31
It just doesn't feel like we're breaking up.
這種感覺不像是分手

112
00:08:10,42 --> 00:08:13,22
No,we are. I'm sad.
是分手啊，我好傷心喔

113
00:08:14,46 --> 00:08:15,82
好吧

114
00:08:21,10 --> 00:08:23,86
Can you wait till tomorrow? All right.
可以等到明天嗎？好吧

115
00:08:25,53 --> 00:08:26,73
Unbelievable!
真是帥呆了

116
00:08:28,04 --> 00:08:29,23
Thanks.
謝謝

117
00:08:30,61 --> 00:08:32,66
That was my boss. I have to go.
不是，我得去見我的老闆 好

118
00:08:34,88 --> 00:08:36,00
What are you doing?
你幹什麼？

119
00:08:36,24 --> 00:08:38,04
-I'm getting dressed. -Why?
穿衣服 為什麼？

120
00:08:38,61 --> 00:08:41,61
When I walk outside naked, people throw garbage.
光著屁股走在路上會被扔東西

121
00:08:42,38 --> 00:08:44,91
Wait. I want to show you something.
等一下，給你看個東西

122
00:08:45,59 --> 00:08:46,58
What is it?
什麼東西？

123
00:08:47,09 --> 00:08:49,72
Just a little gag gift somebody gave me.
別人送的一個小道具

124
00:08:50,22 --> 00:08:51,85
Put your hands together.
把手合在一起

125
00:08:53,46 --> 00:08:55,22
You're not the boss of me.
你又不是我的老闆

126
00:08:57,53 --> 00:08:58,73
Yeah,you are.
你是

127
00:09:02,44 --> 00:09:03,60
Saucy!
粉辣喔

128
00:09:09,31 --> 00:09:11,21
I'll be back in two minutes.
我馬上回來

129
00:09:12,65 --> 00:09:14,81
You're going to leave me like this?
你要這樣把我掛著？

130
00:09:14,98 --> 00:09:19,15
Knowing you're here waiting for me. I think it's exciting,don't you?
知道你在等我 感覺很令人興奮

131
00:09:19,75 --> 00:09:22,05
If you don't come back soon...
好，但要是你不馬上回來…

132
00:09:22,49 --> 00:09:25,39
...there's pretty much nothing I can do about it!
我也不能怎麼樣

133
00:09:29,00 --> 00:09:30,86
I brought you back a macaroon.
我幫你帶了杏仁餅回來

134
00:09:31,10 --> 00:09:34,07
Great. I'll keep it in my butt with your nose.
很好，我會把它帖在屁股上

135
00:09:41,28 --> 00:09:43,07
That's weird. She locked the door.
奇怪，她把門鎖上了

136
00:09:43,34 --> 00:09:46,34
You know why? She's got the bonus list in there.
你知道為什麼？ 裡面有聖誕獎金名單

137
00:09:46,55 --> 00:09:48,34
I saw her working on it today.
我早上看到她在打

138
00:09:49,35 --> 00:09:50,78
Swear you won't tell.
好，你可別說出去

139
00:09:51,02 --> 00:09:54,01
When Mark left,he gave me a key to her office.
馬克離職時給了我一把鑰匙

140
00:09:54,26 --> 00:09:55,98
You want to see the list?
你想看名單嗎？ 想

141
00:10:10,57 --> 00:10:11,66
How are you?
你好嗎？

143
00:10:34,63 --> 00:10:38,12
Hello,Joanna
喂，喬安娜…

144
00:10:38,27 --> 00:10:40,67
office.
…辦公室

145
00:10:41,60 --> 00:10:43,93
I'm sorry. I'll be a little longer.
對不起，我還要一陣子

146
00:10:44,14 --> 00:10:46,66
-How little? -A couple hours.
多久？ 2個小時，我急死了

147
00:10:46,91 --> 00:10:49,27
This isn't funny. Get back here now!
一點也不好玩，馬上給我回來

148
00:10:49,48 --> 00:10:50,64
-I can't! -Why not?
我沒辦法 為什麼？

149
00:10:50,85 --> 00:10:52,68
I'm in my boss' car.
我在我老闆的車上

150
00:10:52,91 --> 00:10:54,61
-What? -Tunnel!
什麼？ 進隧道了

151
00:11:12,37 --> 00:11:13,36
What?
怎樣？

152
00:11:13,60 --> 00:11:16,26
Rachel,could I see you for a moment?
瑞秋，你進來一下

153
00:11:23,61 --> 00:11:25,64
Okay,here's the situation.
好，現在是這樣

154
00:11:26,45 --> 00:11:28,78
The keys to the cuffs are on the door.
手銬的鑰匙掛在門上

155
00:11:28,98 --> 00:11:30,21
Could you be a doll...
你能不能行行好

156
00:11:30,45 --> 00:11:33,78
...and grab them and scoot on over here and unlock me?
拿了鑰匙衝過來幫我解套？

157
00:11:35,09 --> 00:11:38,75
And on a totally separate subject, that's a lovely pantsuit.
題外話：好漂亮的套裝

158
00:11:41,10 --> 00:11:44,19
You promised you would break up with her.
你答應要跟她分手的

159
00:11:44,33 --> 00:11:48,50
I did break up with her! She just took it really,really well!
我跟她分手啦 只不過她分得很狂野

160
00:11:50,71 --> 00:11:54,20
Jeopardizing my career never entered your mind?
你都沒想過 這樣會破壞我的事業？

161
00:11:54,48 --> 00:11:55,87
It did enter my mind.
我想過啊

162
00:11:56,08 --> 00:12:00,07
But then something happened that made it shoot right out.
但後來的事讓這個念頭飛了

163
00:12:01,58 --> 00:12:05,35
You got yourself into those cuffs, you get yourself out.
你害自己被銬住，就自己脫困

164
00:12:07,35 --> 00:12:09,72
I can't get myself right out of them.
不，我沒辦法自己脫困

165
00:12:09,99 --> 00:12:13,72
You must have me confused with the "Amazing Chandler"!
你把我跟脫逃大師錢德搞混了

166
00:12:14,03 --> 00:12:18,26
Unlock me! She could be gone for hours,and I'm cold and....
幫幫我啦，她可能要去很久 我好冷，而且…

167
00:12:22,17 --> 00:12:23,43
All right! This is it!
錢德！好，夠了

168
00:12:23,70 --> 00:12:25,33
Never see her again.
不准你再見她

169
00:12:25,71 --> 00:12:26,73
Never!
永遠

170
00:12:27,01 --> 00:12:29,84
-Never come in here again. -Fine!
不准再進這個辦公室 好

171
00:12:30,24 --> 00:12:32,18
Give me back my Walkman!
把隨身聽還給我 我…

173
00:12:34,42 --> 00:12:35,91
I never borrowed it.
我沒借過

174
00:12:37,05 --> 00:12:38,75
Then I lost it. Buy me one!
那就是我弄丟了，買一台給我

175
00:12:39,02 --> 00:12:42,22
You got it! Here we go! Come on. This is great!
沒問題，快解開吧，太好了

176
00:12:45,33 --> 00:12:46,38
Does it hurt?
會痛嗎？

177
00:12:46,93 --> 00:12:50,80
No,I always see guys do this when handcuffs are taken off.
我只是看別人都會哀一聲

178
00:12:53,10 --> 00:12:54,97
Hello,sweet pants!
親愛的褲子

179
00:12:56,37 --> 00:12:58,53
Wait! What will you tell Joanna?
慢著！你要怎麼跟喬安娜說？

180
00:12:58,91 --> 00:12:59,90
About what?
說什麼？

181
00:13:00,14 --> 00:13:04,74
She'll see you're gone and know I let you out,and I'll get fired!
她看你走了會知道是我放的 我會被解雇

182
00:13:04,95 --> 00:13:06,88
I'll tell a lie! I'm good at lying!
我會撒謊，我最會撒謊了

183
00:13:07,08 --> 00:13:09,05
I actually did borrow your Walkman!
我的確借了你的隨身聽

184
00:13:09,58 --> 00:13:12,45
She'll know I have a key to her office.
行不通的，她會知道我有鑰匙

185
00:13:12,65 --> 00:13:14,75
I've got to lock you back up.
我得把你銬回去

186
00:13:15,59 --> 00:13:17,06
I don't think so.
你別想

187
00:13:28,74 --> 00:13:30,17
This is much better.
這樣好多了

188
00:13:32,94 --> 00:13:35,31
Here's somebody interesting.
這個人很有意思

189
00:13:35,64 --> 00:13:37,91
What do you know about Van Gogh?
你對梵谷認識多少？

190
00:13:38,75 --> 00:13:40,98
-He cut off his ear. -And?
他割掉自己的耳朵 還有呢？

191
00:13:41,58 --> 00:13:42,91
I'm out.
沒了

192
00:13:43,65 --> 00:13:45,24
He painted that.
這是他畫的

193
00:13:46,79 --> 00:13:48,15
That's pretty nice.
不賴嘛

194
00:13:48,52 --> 00:13:51,46
I thought he cut off his ear because he sucked.
我以為他是罰自己畫不好

195
00:13:51,69 --> 00:13:54,29
-What else you got in there? -Let's see....
還有什麼？ 我看看

196
00:13:54,96 --> 00:13:57,29
-Where does the Pope live? -ln the woods.
教宗住在哪裡？ 森林裡

197
00:13:59,17 --> 00:14:01,46
Wait,that's the joke answer.
等等，那是開玩笑的

198
00:14:02,44 --> 00:14:04,63
Actually,it's Vatican City.
他住在梵蒂岡

199
00:14:04,84 --> 00:14:08,50
Now,what do you know about vulcanized rubber?
你知道什麼是硫化橡膠？ （另義保險套）

200
00:14:08,71 --> 00:14:10,54
Spock's birth control.
節育用品

201
00:14:12,78 --> 00:14:14,84
You need these books.
你需要這套書

202
00:14:22,46 --> 00:14:24,19
This used to be your room?
這裡是你的舊房間？

203
00:14:24,63 --> 00:14:28,12
You must have been in really good shape as a kid.
你小時候一定很健美

204
00:14:30,46 --> 00:14:32,90
I'm such an idiot!
我真是個白癡

205
00:14:33,37 --> 00:14:36,13
I can't believe I thought she could change.
我居然以為她會改變

206
00:14:36,54 --> 00:14:39,17
Who cares what your mom thinks?
誰管你娘怎麼想？

207
00:14:39,41 --> 00:14:41,64
So you "pulled a Monica."
搞摩妮卡飛機又怎樣

208
00:14:42,71 --> 00:14:44,87
I'm glad that's catching on.
這句話還真流行

209
00:14:45,08 --> 00:14:49,21
Why does that have to be a bad thing? Just change what it means.
誰說這一定要是壞話？ 去改變它的意義

210
00:14:49,42 --> 00:14:51,04
Prove your mother wrong.
去證明你媽是錯的

211
00:14:51,25 --> 00:14:55,19
You finish the job,and we'll call that "pulling a Monica."
你把工作順利完成 我們就管它叫搞摩妮卡飛機

212
00:14:55,89 --> 00:14:56,88
What?
什麼？

213
00:14:57,66 --> 00:15:02,72
If a kid gets straight A's, his parents say,"You pulled a Monica."
小孩每一科都拿A， 父母會說 「你搞了摩妮卡飛機」

214
00:15:04,50 --> 00:15:08,09
A fireman saves a baby, and they go,"He pulled a Monica."
消防員救出一個寶寶 大家會說「他搞摩妮卡飛機」

215
00:15:10,27 --> 00:15:14,07
Someone hits a homer,and they say, "That one's out of here."
有人打全壘打，播報員會說 「這是一支紅不讓」

216
00:15:14,28 --> 00:15:16,37
Because some things don't change.
有些事是不會變的

217
00:15:17,91 --> 00:15:19,78
All right. I'll go down there.
好，我要下樓去

218
00:15:20,51 --> 00:15:23,92
I won't serve the lasagna. I'll serve what I make.
我不上千層面 我要上我做的菜

219
00:15:32,89 --> 00:15:34,95
My breasts are really strong.
我的咪咪真有力

220
00:15:42,70 --> 00:15:47,44
I have to get you locked back up. I'm so going to lose my job!
錢德，拜託，我得把你銬回去 我的飯碗快不保了

221
00:15:47,64 --> 00:15:50,20
She's very private about her office!
她很在意辦公室的隱私權

222
00:15:50,71 --> 00:15:52,58
Now I know why!
我總算知道原因了

223
00:15:53,08 --> 00:15:54,95
You're in trouble either way.
你不管怎樣都有麻煩

224
00:15:55,22 --> 00:15:57,41
If she sees me locked to this...
她看見我被銬在櫃子上

225
00:15:57,65 --> 00:16:01,31
...she'll know you were here. You might as well let me go.
就會知道你進來過 你還不如讓我走

226
00:16:03,99 --> 00:16:07,89
-I'll clean your bathroom for a month. -Still won't be clean.
我幫你洗浴室1個月 還是洗不乾淨

227
00:16:08,16 --> 00:16:10,72
All I want is my freedom.
我只要我的自由

228
00:16:11,97 --> 00:16:13,76
-Foot rubs for a month! -Freedom!
揉腳1個月 自由

229
00:16:14,00 --> 00:16:17,84
-I'll put all your photos into albums! -I want my freedom!
把你的相片通通整理好 自由，我要我的自由

230
00:16:18,07 --> 00:16:20,56
Why won't you hear me! Sophie,help me!
你為什麼不聽 蘇菲，救救我

231
00:16:20,81 --> 00:16:22,44
Sophie,sit!
蘇菲，坐下

232
00:16:22,81 --> 00:16:24,37
自由

233
00:16:24,75 --> 00:16:26,58
Would you just calm down?!
請你冷靜好嗎

234
00:16:33,95 --> 00:16:36,75
I'm going to say this for the last time.
我再說最後一次

235
00:16:36,96 --> 00:16:39,08
Would you please just
能不能請你…

236
00:16:43,70 --> 00:16:46,36
There's a lot I didn't know about vomit.
我對嘔吐的瞭解還真少

237
00:16:50,10 --> 00:16:51,37
In a minute.
等一下

238
00:16:53,27 --> 00:16:54,67
So what do you say?
你覺得如何？

239
00:16:54,94 --> 00:16:58,38
You get the whole set of encyclopedias for $1200.
1200元擁有整套百科全書

240
00:16:58,78 --> 00:17:01,68
That works out to just 50 bucks a book.
平均一本才50元

241
00:17:01,88 --> 00:17:03,51
$1200?
1200？

242
00:17:05,39 --> 00:17:07,32
You think I have $1200?
你覺得我有1200嗎？

243
00:17:08,22 --> 00:17:09,92
I'm home during the day...
我大白天窩在家裡

244
00:17:10,12 --> 00:17:13,32
...and I got patio furniture in my living room.
還用涼椅洋傘當傢俱

245
00:17:14,40 --> 00:17:17,96
There's a few things you don't get from book learning.
有些事是書上學不到的

246
00:17:18,30 --> 00:17:20,03
Well,what can you swing?
你能湊出多少？

247
00:17:20,80 --> 00:17:24,86
How about zero down and zero a month for a long,long time?
0頭期款，月付0元如何？

248
00:17:25,87 --> 00:17:28,24
You don't have anything?
你什麼都沒有？

249
00:17:28,51 --> 00:17:30,37
You want to see what I got?
你想看我有什麼？好

250
00:17:31,05 --> 00:17:34,01
I got a baby Tootsie Roll...
我有一個巧克力棒

251
00:17:34,35 --> 00:17:37,75
...a movie stub,keys,a Kleenex...
一張電影票根、鑰匙、面紙

252
00:17:40,09 --> 00:17:41,52
...a rock...
一塊小石頭

253
00:17:42,02 --> 00:17:43,89
...and an army man.
和一個玩具兵

254
00:17:44,76 --> 00:17:48,19
Okay,I get the picture. Thanks for your time.
好，我懂了，耽誤你了

255
00:17:49,06 --> 00:17:51,16
And a fifty.
和一張50元

256
00:17:51,47 --> 00:17:53,37
These must be Chandler's pants.
這一定是錢德的褲子

257
00:17:54,23 --> 00:17:56,10
For $50 you can get one book.
50元可以買一本

258
00:17:56,40 --> 00:17:59,17
What will it be? A? B? C?
你要哪一本？A？B？C？

259
00:17:59,41 --> 00:18:01,03
I'll stick with the V.
我還是買V好了

260
00:18:01,24 --> 00:18:04,11
I want to see how this bad boy turns out.
我想看看結局如何

261
00:18:07,75 --> 00:18:11,68
I will buy and wrap all of your Christmas gifts!
我幫你買和包聖誕禮物

262
00:18:13,12 --> 00:18:16,58
I'll squeeze you fresh orange juice every morning!
我每天早上幫你搾柳橙汁

263
00:18:16,92 --> 00:18:18,29
-With extra pulp? -Yeah.
有果肉？ 有

264
00:18:18,56 --> 00:18:19,72
不要

265
00:18:23,63 --> 00:18:24,79
I've got it!
我知道了

266
00:18:25,30 --> 00:18:27,46
You don't have it.
你才不知道

267
00:18:27,73 --> 00:18:29,43
I have so got it!
我完全知道了

268
00:18:30,20 --> 00:18:33,20
There will be rumors about this. No way to stop it.
這件事會傳出去，擋也擋不住

269
00:18:33,41 --> 00:18:35,40
Sophie,Monica and Phoebe know.
蘇菲知道 摩妮卡、菲比知道

270
00:18:35,64 --> 00:18:37,54
-How do they know? -I called them.
她們怎麼會知道？ 我打給她們了

271
00:18:39,05 --> 00:18:41,28
When they ask me what I saw...
當她們問我看到什麼

272
00:18:41,48 --> 00:18:44,58
...I can be very generous...
我可以很大方

273
00:18:46,32 --> 00:18:48,41
...or very stingy.
也可以很小氣

274
00:18:50,66 --> 00:18:51,99
Go on.
說下去

275
00:18:52,26 --> 00:18:54,09
I can make you a legend.
我可以讓你成為傳奇

276
00:18:54,96 --> 00:18:58,83
I can make you this generation's Milton Berle.
我可以讓你成為現代唐璜

277
00:18:59,73 --> 00:19:03,23
-And Milton Berle has -Not compared to you.
而唐璜… 根本比不上你

278
00:19:08,18 --> 00:19:10,30
They're not even touching the lasagna.
怎樣？ 客人碰都沒碰千層面

279
00:19:10,58 --> 00:19:11,91
They love your casserole!
真的？ 他們好喜歡你的砂鍋

280
00:19:13,01 --> 00:19:16,74
It's hard to believe a while ago this was just ingredients.
漂亮 不久前這些都還是材料呢

282
00:19:19,42 --> 00:19:21,58
Everyone seems to like your dish.
大家都很喜歡你做的菜

283
00:19:22,12 --> 00:19:23,11
And you?
那你呢？

284
00:19:23,82 --> 00:19:25,45
I thought it was...
我覺得…

285
00:19:26,79 --> 00:19:28,26
...quite tasty.
很好吃

286
00:19:29,53 --> 00:19:32,47
So if everyone liked it, and you liked it...
要是大家都喜歡，你也喜歡

287
00:19:32,70 --> 00:19:36,03
...that would make this a success. Which would make you....
那就代表很成功，而你就是…

288
00:19:36,30 --> 00:19:38,17
A bitch?
惡婆娘？

289
00:19:39,27 --> 00:19:41,71
I meant "wrong," but we can use your word.
我想說「你就錯了」 但你的說法也行

290
00:19:43,21 --> 00:19:45,34
Yes,well,I was wrong.
對，我錯了

291
00:19:45,95 --> 00:19:47,64
And I have to say...
我必須要說

292
00:19:48,95 --> 00:19:50,88
...you really impressed me today.
你讓我大開眼界

293
00:19:53,95 --> 00:19:57,05
You might even say that she "pulled a Monica."
你還可以說她搞了摩妮卡飛機

294
00:19:59,69 --> 00:20:01,99
She doesn't know we switched it.
她不知道我們改過了

295
00:20:03,20 --> 00:20:06,46
And the next time you cater for me...
下次你幫我辦外燴

296
00:20:07,20 --> 00:20:10,30
...there will be nothing but ice in the freezer.
冷凍庫裡只會有冰

297
00:20:10,80 --> 00:20:12,47
That really means a lot.
這是很大的鼓勵

298
00:20:12,87 --> 00:20:15,07
Mom,don't bite your nails!
媽，別咬指甲

299
00:20:18,88 --> 00:20:21,14
（中央咖啡館）

300
00:20:24,15 --> 00:20:25,98
Hello,Chandler.
錢德你好啊

301
00:20:27,99 --> 00:20:29,51
I love you.
我愛你

302
00:20:30,92 --> 00:20:32,22
What's going on?
怎麼回事？

303
00:20:36,23 --> 00:20:37,93
No,he doesn't!
少來了

304
00:20:40,93 --> 00:20:42,60
Two hours,that lasted.
拖了2小時

305
00:20:44,10 --> 00:20:46,04
So did you break up with Joanna?
所以你跟喬安娜分手了嗎？

306
00:20:46,27 --> 00:20:47,54
I think so.
應該是吧

307
00:20:47,84 --> 00:20:51,78
It's good you got out, before she blew up like Vesuvius.
幸好她跟維蘇威一樣爆炸之前 你就閃了

308
00:20:52,75 --> 00:20:54,24
The volcano?
那座火山？

309
00:20:54,55 --> 00:20:59,54
Speaking of volcanoes,man,are they a violent igneous rock formation!
對，講到火山 那些火成岩還真暴力

310
00:21:00,59 --> 00:21:01,58
What?
什麼？ 

311
00:21:01,79 --> 00:21:04,52
Lava spewing,hot ash.
熔岩亂噴，熱灰亂飛

312
00:21:04,73 --> 00:21:06,52
Of course,some are dormant.
不過有些是休眠火山

313
00:21:06,73 --> 00:21:09,75
Why are you talking about volcanoes all of a sudden?
你怎麼突然聊起火山來了？

314
00:21:10,03 --> 00:21:11,09
We don't have to.
不一定要聊火山

315
00:21:11,30 --> 00:21:13,70
What do you want to talk about? Vivisection?
你們想聊什麼？活體解剖？

316
00:21:14,97 --> 00:21:16,94
The vas deferens?
輸精管？

317
00:21:17,70 --> 00:21:19,60
The Vietnam War?
越戰？

318
00:21:19,91 --> 00:21:23,21
Did anyone see that documentary on the Korean War?
有人看那部韓戰紀錄片嗎？

319
00:21:25,48 --> 00:21:27,21
Korea's a beautiful country.
韓國那麼美

320
00:21:27,41 --> 00:21:29,25
With such a sad history.
命運卻好悲慘

321
00:21:30,48 --> 00:21:32,21
Could there be more Kims?
有好多姓金的

322
00:21:41,80 --> 00:21:44,06
-Who's out there? -Me! Good morning!
外面是誰？ 是我，早安

323
00:21:44,26 --> 00:21:46,13
Could you come in here,please?
瑞秋，你能不能進來一下？

324
00:21:46,33 --> 00:21:49,46
Sure! They didn't have poppyseed bagels...
好 沒有罌粟籽焙果了

325
00:21:50,10 --> 00:21:53,10
...so I have sesame Oh,my word!
所以我買芝麻…天哪

326
00:21:54,78 --> 00:21:56,97
I've had a slight office mishap.
我出了一點辦公室災難

327
00:21:58,91 --> 00:22:00,68
Could you get the key for me?
請把門後的鑰匙拿給我 好

328
00:22:11,49 --> 00:22:14,32
-lf you could. -Oh,I'm sorry!
麻煩你 對不起

329
00:22:16,80 --> 00:22:20,79
You can tell your friend Chandler we're definitely broken up this time!
告訴你的朋友錢德 我們這次絕對是分手了

330
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


331
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


